  hearMoreName: EnvironmentalHearMore01
  hearMoreText: "The infrastructure layer of software \u2014 including servers, networks,
    and cloud storage \u2014 must be designed with energy efficiency in mind, such
    as using low-power servers, optimizing data center cooling, and scheduling workloads
    during off-peak hours."
